      "resident threads / unit : 2,048\n",
      "units reported          : 18\n",
      "resident threads total  : 36,864   (1,152 warps)\n",
      "FP32 ALUs               : 2,304\n",
      "over-subscription       : 16x more work loaded than executable\n",
      "\n",
      "a 4096x4096 matmul, 1 thread per output : 16,777,216 threads\n",
